## Advanced: Custom Theming

```elixir
brand_theme =
  Choreo.Theme.custom(
    colors: %{
      start: "#10b981",
      end: "#ef4444",
      task: "#3b82f6",
      decision: "#8b5cf6",
      compensation: "#f87171"
    },
    node_fontcolor: "white",
    edge_color: "#94a3b8",
    graph_bgcolor: "#0f172a"
  )

Kino.VizJS.render(Workflow.to_dot(parallel_order, theme: brand_theme))
```

